Modifications for the AHS / Strand Remesh integration:
The JavaScript wrapper's default ES-module export is removed, import.meta.url
is replaced with a fixed embedded-module URL, and the WASM is embedded as base64
and passed to the module factory. AHS adds worker routing, cancellation and
mesh/surface adapters. These changes are not changes to the Manifold WASM.
The WASM bytes are identical to the vendored original npm-package binary.
